+# Tree-sitter grammars
+
+Languages covered by the tree-sitter symbol graph in the MVP (`crates/muninn-symbols`,
+Phase 5), per `README.md` and `design/ENGINE.md`.
+
+| Language | Crate | Extensions |
+|---|---|---|
+| Rust | `tree-sitter-rust` | `.rs` |
+| TypeScript / TSX | `tree-sitter-typescript` | `.ts`, `.tsx` |
+| JavaScript / JSX | `tree-sitter-javascript` | `.js`, `.jsx` |
+| Python | `tree-sitter-python` | `.py` |
+| Go | `tree-sitter-go` | `.go` |
